  "security_implications": "The sp_ prefixed signals directly replicate critical cipher control and data strobes (ctr_ready, cipher_in_ready, cipher_out_valid) and operational mode indicators (cipher_crypt, cipher_dec_key_gen). Unintended glitches or faults on these non-gated combinatorial paths could propagate incorrect handshake or mode selection into the AES pipeline, potentially enabling unauthorized operations, exposing sensitive data, or triggering decryption key generation under attacker control. Therefore, these signals must be treated as security-critical and their drivers verified for integrity.",
